# %% [markdown]
## 25. The three reports (Computer Vision, NLP, Multimodal)

Built with ReportLab **only from artifacts saved by this run** (tables, figures, registry, freeze manifest, final results). The fixed text describes the design; every number, including every number in the discussion and conclusion paragraphs, is read from a file or a table at build time. A model that did not run appears as "Not Run". Missing artifacts are listed on the first page and the title starts with "INCOMPLETE DRAFT". In QUICK_VERIFY mode every page carries the stamp. Tables and paragraphs marked *post-hoc* come from the addendum §23A, which was written after the test block had been opened. Filing text is never printed beyond short n-grams and tokens.

# %%
